<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Dallas Dhu - (built 1990) 7,045 dwt sold within Japan for $5.9 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Stolt Stream - (built 1975) 25,200 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $210 per ldt.</p>
<p>Fast Win - (built 1970) sold to Indian breakers for $165 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
